## Description

The WebMCP Challenge is here.  We’ve teamed up with @ChromiumDev, @CloudflareDev, @ShopifyDevs, @vercel, @render, and @Netlify for a 10-day hackathon.  Up for grabs: $35,000 in cash prizes, Codex Micros, ChatGPT Pro subscriptions, and more prizes from our supporters. https://t.co/J7CGKSxggZ

